    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "一、抽水泵、大灾与“自觉绝食”的蝗虫",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 90,
      "size": 48,
      "bold": true,
      "align": "center",
      "font": "title"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "公元873年，12岁的小皇帝【唐僖宗】登基，大权落入宦官田令孜之手。\n朝廷中枢奢靡贪纵，层层盘剥：\n皇帝压宰相、宰相压百官、百官压军镇，\n最终这台【贪腐抽水泵】，将冰冷屠刀对准了绝境中的老百姓！",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 190,
      "size": 32,
      "align": "center",
      "max_width": 980,
      "line_height": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "file": "b1a_pump.png",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 620,
      "height": 400,
      "anchor": "cc"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "『只要想在体系里混，\n就得开足马力刮地皮！』",
      "x": 195,
      "y": 580,
      "size": 28,
      "bold": true,
      "align": "center",
      "rotate": -3,
      "font": "title",
      "box": {
        "style": "fill",
        "bg": "#F6A83C",
        "color": "#4A2800",
        "pad": [
          12,
          18
        ],
        "tail": "mr"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rule",
      "x1": 140,
      "x2": 940,
      "y": 880,
      "color": "#EFECE6"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "关东连年大旱大水，百姓草籽为面、槐叶为菜，饿殍遍野。\n学士卢携痛陈：『百姓撤屋卖子都交不上，乞敕州县停征残税！』\n小皇帝准了，但官僚体系烂透：〖徒为空文，有司竟不能行〗！",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 940,
      "size": 32,
      "align": "center",
      "max_width": 980,
      "line_height": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "『朝政大事先放放，\n朕的斗鸡和马球赛不能停！』",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 1160,
      "size": 26,
      "bold": true,
      "align": "center",
      "rotate": 2,
      "font": "title",
      "box": {
        "style": "outline",
        "bg": "#FFFFFF",
        "color": "#2F2A26",
        "pad": [
          10,
          16
        ],
        "tail": "bl"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "file": "b1b_starving.png",
      "x": 290,
      "y": 1500,
      "height": 380,
      "anchor": "cc"
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "file": "b1d_emperor.png",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 1500,
      "height": 380,
      "anchor": "cc"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "『拆屋卖子……\n官吏还捶挞催租！』",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 1770,
      "size": 26,
      "bold": true,
      "align": "center",
      "rotate": -2,
      "font": "title",
      "box": {
